<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BA CEO named to Qantas board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BA CEO named to Qantas board.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc's chief executive officer, Robert Ayling, has been appointed to the board of Qantas Airways Ltd, British Airways Investments (Australia) Pty Ltd said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Ayling replaces BA's chairman, Sir Colin Marshall, on the Qantas board, it said in a stock exchange notice.</p>
<p>BA holds 25 percent of Qantas's issued capital.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
